# SKOS — the semantic-relation reasoning core of the W3C Simple Knowledge
# Organization System (skos:core, Miles & Bechhofer, W3C Recommendation 2009),
# transcribed faithfully from the official vocabulary (vendored beside this as
# corpus/ontologies/skos.rdf, http://www.w3.org/TR/skos-reference/) into Turtle,
# plus a small ILLUSTRATIVE concept scheme (the `ex:` animal thesaurus below —
# authored here, not part of SKOS) so the broaderTransitive closure forward-chains.
#
# This is the DRAWN fragment: the SKOS classes + the three reasoning-critical
# property axioms (sub-property + transitivity + symmetry) that carry the inference,
# laid out at the §3.3 save boundary in a few seconds. The FULL official vocabulary
# (62 EG axioms, incl. all the inverse / domain / range pairs → 124 relational-scroll
# cuts) is super-linear to draw, so it is vendored as the source of record (skos.rdf)
# and imports fine as data — "M is data, draw only the contested fragment."

@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/animals#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

#  ── SKOS classes ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
skos:Concept        a owl:Class .
skos:ConceptScheme  a owl:Class ; owl:disjointWith skos:Concept .
skos:Collection     a owl:Class ; owl:disjointWith skos:Concept , skos:ConceptScheme .

#  ── SKOS semantic relations (the reasoning core) ────────────────────────────
#  broader ⊑ broaderTransitive, and broaderTransitive is transitive — so a chain of
#  broader links closes to the full ancestor relation.  related is symmetric.  All
#  roll up to semanticRelation.
skos:broaderTransitive a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:TransitiveProperty ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf skos:semanticRelation .

skos:broader a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf skos:broaderTransitive .

skos:related a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:SymmetricProperty ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf skos:semanticRelation .

#  ── An illustrative concept scheme (authored here — NOT part of SKOS) ────────
#  A small animal thesaurus.  `X skos:broader Y` reads "Y is broader than X", so the
#  chain runs species → genus.  The closure derives e.g. `ex:Dog broaderTransitive
#  ex:Animal`; `ex:Dog related ex:Wolf` closes symmetrically to `ex:Wolf related ex:Dog`.
ex:animals a skos:ConceptScheme .

ex:Animal    a skos:Concept .
ex:Mammal    a skos:Concept ; skos:broader ex:Animal    ; skos:inScheme ex:animals .
ex:Carnivore a skos:Concept ; skos:broader ex:Mammal    ; skos:inScheme ex:animals .
ex:Dog       a skos:Concept ; skos:broader ex:Carnivore ; skos:inScheme ex:animals .
ex:Cat       a skos:Concept ; skos:broader ex:Carnivore ; skos:inScheme ex:animals .
ex:Wolf      a skos:Concept ; skos:broader ex:Carnivore ; skos:inScheme ex:animals .

ex:Dog skos:related ex:Wolf .
